## What NOT to do locally

<!--
  Concrete gotchas specific to this repo. Cross-reference AGENTS.md's
  "Things to Avoid" section — same content, different framing.
  If AGENTS.md's guidance and this file's guidance drift, agents get
  contradictory signals.
-->

- Do not disable pre-commit hooks with `git commit --no-verify`. If a hook is wrong, fix the hook, don't skip it.
- Do not run migrations against production databases from your local machine. Migrations run in CI/CD.
- Do not commit anything to `.env` — only `.env.example`.
